log/minami.hoshino/img/2014/05/03/1942687/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2014/05/03/1942687/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんは舞台で一緒に出れなかったけど、今回のアンダーメンバーでライブできてほんとよかったでーす笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2014/05/03/1942687/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな大好き！"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-3305":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は初めての全国握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/8620270/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が来てくださって、感激しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"屋外ライブは、暖かい日差しと温かいみなさんの声援の中で気持ちよくでき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会はみなさんにほんとに優しく声をかけてもらえてうれしかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/8620270/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉と一緒に和気あいあいできてよかった〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも姉さんと写真撮るの忘れちゃったので、また後日撮りますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/8620270/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真は移動中。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影：ちーちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.iku