ype":"paragraph","text":"ちょいロックな青でヒビ入ってるだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気分でね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワ、ワ...わいるどだろお。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返す！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.扇風機は三枚羽、四枚羽、五枚羽の中でどれ派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.えーと、えーと、確かうちの扇風機は、4枚だった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみは、美白派？それともガングロ派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.それはもちろん美白派でしょー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色白になりたい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.ところであみあみは夏バテ対策してる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.えー特にしてないっ！だめかな？？ ( ◞˟૩˟)◞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.これからも仲良くしてくるならゴツンと来て下さい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ゴツン！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.握手会で生年月日が一緒っていったらわかる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.わかるよーーー(#^.^#)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.漫画は好きですか？｢ぱにぽに｣って作品読んだことありますか？面白いから読んでみてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.漫画は好きだけよ！！読み出したら止まらなくなる！！ぱにぽに？？かわいー(^ ^)今度探してみよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.行ってみたい国はある?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ボラボラ島！！ググってみて！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.なんか見落としたり、ちょっと内容忘れちゃったりしてあみあみのブログの過去の記事で回答した質問に似たの聞いちゃったとき、あみちゃんは「こいつ何も知らねえのかよｗｗｗ何回も同じこと聞くんじゃねえｗｗ」とか思ったりするの？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.そんな事思わないよお＿|￣|○！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただあみのブログをちゃんと最後まで見てないな？っていうのはわかっちゃう(￣▽￣)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.好きな俳優とかいる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、ぼくはジョニーデップが一番好きです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.俳優さんかあ......堺雅人さん！！演技が自然だしユニークだし尊敬する！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.今更ながらコメント始めていい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか申し訳ない気がして..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.いいよ全然(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのかわり今度は毎回絶対にコメしてよ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.能條さんのアカン飯は？？...アカン飯分かるカナ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.アカン警察よね！んーなんだろ、意外とあみアカンくないんだよねー。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみって絵書くのって得意？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.全然！！！まったく！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むしろ苦手です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.基本、派手な服が多いのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あみ本当に気分だからなぁ～。"},{"type":"break"